version: 1.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-01
abstract: >
  A C/C++ static-analysis and optional LLM triage tool with a reproducible
  evaluation suite. Includes commit-disjoint and cross-project comparisons,
  paired repair probes, graph neural and Weisfeiler-Lehman baselines,
  representation ablations, all-family fusion and retained negative results.
  No state-of-the-art detection claim is made.
keywords:
  - software security
  - static analysis
  - large language models
  - vulnerability detection
  - hybrid approach
  - graph neural networks
  - reproducibility
  - CWE
  - Juliet
license: MIT
